# tools.list — the tools ~/dev/rust/README.md lists, with their path and version.
# command | how to ask its version | what it is for
rustc         | rustc --version         | the compiler (cargo calls it for you)
cargo         | cargo --version         | builds, runs, tests and fetches crates: `cargo new`, `cargo run`
rust-analyzer | rust-analyzer --version | the language server the editors use
rustfmt       | rustfmt --version       | formats code: `cargo fmt`
cargo-clippy  | cargo clippy --version  | lints: `cargo clippy` explains what could be better
rust-gdb      | -                       | gdb that shows Rust values readably: `rust-gdb target/debug/x`
